$MDESC::Type = "Star Wars";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Yavin Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> The Galactic Empire has located the Rebel base at Yavin and deployed ground troops for an assault on the base. A Light class Imperial Cruiser hovers near the ground for Imperial troops to stage their attack. The ATAT's at the midpoint of the map have a switch point. Controlling the ATAT attack group will give your team a high tactical advantage over your enemy.  The first team to reach 6 points shall be the victor!";